<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs off $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs off $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $.50 to $1.00 Lower. Demand and supplies were light to moderate. Top $50.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  48.00-49.50, few 50.00</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  43.00-48.00</p>
<p>		210-230 lbs.  39.00-43.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/weak. Top $50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 40.00-42.50 Few 39.00</p>
<p>		450-500 lbs. 44.00-46.00</p>
<p>		500-650 lbs. 46.00-49.00, few over 650 lbs. 50.00</p>
</text>
